    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Assault Missile Backstabber",
  "YangsThoughts": "An all-rounder mech from Quicsell. It's only got SRMs, but those are pretty versatile. It would technically be cooking itself, if it weren't for the fact that half the missiles are used as temporary Streak modules for the other half, meaning only successful target locks get launched. Watch that engine though, one side torso, and the mech's toast.",
